    "Photos, your inventory, and chat messages are sent to Anthropic's API when you use AI features." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las fotos, tu inventario y los mensajes del chat se envían a la API de Anthropic cuando usas las funciones de IA."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 기능을 사용하면 사진, 보유 재료, 채팅 메시지가 Anthropic API로 전송돼요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用 AI 功能时，照片、你的库存和聊天消息会发送到 Anthropic 的 API。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick a cooking video you saved or screen-recorded. It's read on this phone; only the words and a few frames are sent to Claude." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elige un video de cocina que guardaste o grabaste de la pantalla. Se lee en este teléfono; solo el texto y algunos cuadros se envían a Claude."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "저장하거나 화면 녹화한 요리 영상을 선택하세요. 영상은 이 iPhone에서 분석하고, 텍스트와 일부 프레임만 Claude로 전송돼요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选一个你保存或录屏的烹饪视频。视频在这台 iPhone 上读取，只有文字和几帧画面会发送给 Claude。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Picks favor food that's about to go bad, recipes you can make without shopping, and things you haven't had lately." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las sugerencias priorizan comida que está por echarse a perder, recetas que puedes hacer sin comprar y cosas que no has comido últimamente."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "곧 상할 음식, 장보지 않고 만들 수 있는 레시피, 최근에 먹지 않은 메뉴를 우선 추천해요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "推荐会优先考虑快要变质的食物、无需购物就能做的食谱，以及你最近没吃过的菜。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Picky eaters" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para quisquillosos"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "입맛 까다로운 사람용"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "挑食友好"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Pies, roasts and cozy puddings from Britain and Ireland." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pasteles salados, asados y pudines reconfortantes de Gran Bretaña e Irlanda."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
